  },
  {
    "id": "agentic/zenith",
    "name": "Zenith",
    "description": "Premium frontier router: hard reasoning and review to claude-opus, code to a codex model, math to deepseek-pro, research/long context/vision to gemini, but small talk still on the free local model so chit-chat does not burn opus.",
